    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d431-a1">

                <pb facs="0678" n="658" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg658"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Cole to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Frederickton, N. B.</hi></placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-07-19"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 19, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>A person calling himself Captain Collins, (not Hollins,) with two others, were
                    arrested while breaking into Calais Bank. Quite certain that no raid is
                    contemplated from this quarter; my attention has been called to subject from
                    reports put in circulation here a day or two since.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. COLE, <hi rendition="#italic">Administrator.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>To <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>
                    </p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
